=================================================================
 That is the tour. What is left is breadth, and it is large:
 over a thousand : commands, eight keymap presets, twelve
 embedded languages.

 Three keys keep finding the rest of it:

   SPC SPC    the command palette, over every command
   SPC h h    the Help browser
   SPC ?      the bindings of whatever keymap you are in

 The book under book/ and the FAQ (SPC h f) go deeper than a
 tutorial can. :tutor and SPC h t reopen this file later.

 To leave, type :q! (this buffer is scratch, so nothing you
 typed here is saved anywhere).




